  "description": "Caching layer for Bodu.Financial exchange-rate providers. Provides CachingRateProvider, a decorator that wraps any IDatedRateProvider and serves fresh rates from a shared on-disk cache (one TOML file per provider and currency pair), plus an AggregatingRateProvider (priority-fallback, averaging, per-pair routing). Includes the dependency-injection registrations (AddCachedRateProvider, AddAggregatedRateProvider) on IFinancialServiceBuilder.",
